{"2496330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tremble of Towers", "steam_appid": 2496330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4866030], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for Action in Tremble of Towers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to defend your golden vein in <strong>Tremble of Towers</strong>, a unique take on the Tower defense genre with cooperative gameplay for up to 4 players! Work together to fend off waves of unique enemies ranging from carts and planes to massive, moving fortresses, all while exploring an ever-changing, auto-generated world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/0992f0291b38e42673c8c145bce77779.poster.avif?t=1788286148\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/0992f0291b38e42673c8c145bce77779.webm?t=1788286148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/0992f0291b38e42673c8c145bce77779.mp4?t=1788286148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes Tremble of Towers unique from other tower defense games is the ability to build any structure with any resource; ice freezes, magma burns, lead increases range, wood increases critical damage, etc... combine these resources with any structure you want to give it the traits that you desire. For example: build an Arc Turret (A turret that fires bullets that travel up to 4 nearby enemies) with the ice mineral, and you get an <strong>Icy Arc Turret;</strong> capable of slowing 4 enemies at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >countless of other clever combinations of structures are waiting for you to be made...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/48ab3f2ea9abbbdb4854551d5ec38ef7.poster.avif?t=1788286148\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/48ab3f2ea9abbbdb4854551d5ec38ef7.webm?t=1788286148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/48ab3f2ea9abbbdb4854551d5ec38ef7.mp4?t=1788286148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its engaging gameplay, teamwork-focused mechanics, and endless replayability, <strong>Tremble of Towers</strong> delivers an unforgettable Co-op experience for you and your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP Tower Defense:</strong> Play solo or team up with up to 4 players in a cooperative defense game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the map</strong> and find useful mineral deposits, chests, or mobs that can aid you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and Build:</strong> Use your resources to build turrets, miners, walls, and support structures to strengthen your defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-Based Strategy:</strong> Tasks including repair damaged structures, protect one another, scout the map for treasures, mine resources, and fend off enemies must be handled strategically between your teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong> Survive increasingly difficult enemy waves while ensuring your Goal Stone remains untouched. Victory is achieved when you and your team make it through all waves unscathed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Multiple maps, game modes, and play-styles await you every time you play, ensuring a fresh and exciting experience with every match.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for Action in Tremble of Towers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to defend your golden vein in <strong>Tremble of Towers</strong>, a unique take on the Tower defense genre with cooperative gameplay for up to 4 players! Work together to fend off waves of unique enemies ranging from carts and planes to massive, moving fortresses, all while exploring an ever-changing, auto-generated world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/0992f0291b38e42673c8c145bce77779.poster.avif?t=1788286148\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/0992f0291b38e42673c8c145bce77779.webm?t=1788286148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496330/extras/0992f0291b38e42673c8c145bce77779.mp4?t=1788286148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes Tremble of Towers unique from other tower defense games is the ability to build any structure with any resource; ice freezes, magma burns, lead increases range, wood increases critical damage, etc... combine these resources with any structure you want to give it the traits that you desire. For example: build an Arc Turret (A turret that fires bullets that travel up to 4 nearby enemies) with the ice mineral, and you get an <strong>Icy Arc Turret;</strong> capable of slowing 4 enemies at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >countless of other clever combinations of structures are waiting for you to be made...<